==================================================================
 FORWARD-MODEL VERDICT
==================================================================
  off_axis     marginal
  gabor        marginal

Every arm is MARGINAL: the term tells a reconstruction from nonsense
but cannot refine one that is already close. That is a reportable
diagnostic and a legitimate negative result about physics-consistency
losses under a non-invertible acquisition pipeline. It is not trained
by default. To test it anyway:
    python main.py train --config config/v2/d_forward_amplitude.yaml
and check that the phase metrics do not degrade against the base run.
